      "content": "AI & Machine Learning | Google Cloud Blog AI & Machine Learning Find news, updates, and best practices for AI and machine learning solutions on Google Cloud. AI & Machine Learning Everything Google Cloud customers need to know coming out of Google I/O Today at Google I/O, we’re doubling down on our mission to support the Agentic Enterprise by delivering new AI innovations and putting them directly in the hands of enterprises via Gemini Enterprise, Agent Platform, and Google Workspace. By Thomas Kurian • 11-minute read Read article AI & Machine Learning The new Gemini Enterprise: one platform for agent development, orchestration, and governance By Brian Delahunty • 7-minute read AI & Machine Learning What Google Cloud announced in AI this month By Andrea Sanin • 22-minute read News in short A quick take on updates, announcements, resources, events, and learning opportunities from Google Cloud in one handy location. Updated weekly. Read now Developers & Practitioners Why AI apps fail in production (And how Google solved it) By Stephanie Wong • 4-minute read Security & Identity Now in preview: Find and fix software vulnerabilities with CodeMender By Michael Gerstenhaber • 5-minute read AI & Machine Learning 13 hands-on demos to build on Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform By Shubham Saboo • 6-minute read AI & Machine Learning Google is a Leader and positioned furthest in Vision and highest in Execution in the 2026 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Conversational AI Platforms By Ali Rana • 5-minute read Security & Identity Cloud CISO Perspectives: How AI leverages deep context as the defender’s advantage By Francis deSouza • 9-minute read Compute Three lessons in accelerating foundation model upgrades By Radhika Mani • 4-minute read Networking IDC: Why the right networking approach is foundational to agentic AI By Taranvir Singh • 4-minute read AI & Machine Learning Google named a Leader in the 2026 IDC MarketScape for Worldwide Foundation Model Software By Mi